  "description": "High-performance .NET 10 P/Invoke wrapper over the stable qzi C ABI for Qwen-Image 2.1 (turbo/base, LoRA) and Z-Image (bf16/Nunchaku) text-to-image generation. Directly loads the in-process QwenZImageNative library; a CUDA build links the vendored real C/CUDA engine, while the default reference build emits deterministic noise for GPU-free testing. Model packs are configured in QwenZImage.config.json. Ships managed assembly plus win-x64 and linux-x64 native runtimes. No Go, no sidecar server, no HTTP hop.",
